#!markdown

# 02 · Technical Indicators

**English.** Technical indicators turn raw prices into features: trend (moving averages), momentum (RSI, MACD), volatility (Bollinger, ATR), volume (OBV, VWAP) and candlestick patterns. `Finance.TimeSeries` computes them in O(n) with outputs aligned to the input (NaN during warm-up), exposes a searchable `IndicatorCatalog`, and offers streaming versions for live feeds.

**Bahasa Indonesia.** Indikator teknikal mengubah harga mentah menjadi fitur: tren (moving average), momentum (RSI, MACD), volatilitas (Bollinger, ATR), volume (OBV, VWAP) dan pola candlestick. `Finance.TimeSeries` menghitungnya dalam O(n) dengan keluaran yang sejajar dengan input (NaN selama masa pemanasan), menyediakan `IndicatorCatalog` yang dapat ditelusuri, serta versi streaming untuk data langsung.

> Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil

#!csharp

#i "nuget: ../artifacts/packages"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Core, 0.1.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.TimeSeries, 0.1.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Visualization, 0.1.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.RustBridge, 0.1.0"

using Finance.Core.Market;
using Finance.TimeSeries.Indicators;
using Finance.Visualization;
using Finance.RustBridge;

var bars = SyntheticMarket.GeometricBrownianBars(400, startPrice: 100, annualDrift: 0.12, annualVolatility: 0.30, seed: 21);
var close = bars.Select(b => b.Close).ToArray();
var high = bars.Select(b => b.High).ToArray();
var low = bars.Select(b => b.Low).ToArray();
var volume = bars.Select(b => b.Volume).ToArray();

#!markdown

## The catalogue / Katalog indikator

**EN.** Every indicator is registered with its category, description and parameter ranges, so applications (like the Gallery's Indicator Explorer) can build UIs from metadata.

**ID.** Setiap indikator terdaftar beserta kategori, deskripsi dan rentang parameternya, sehingga aplikasi (seperti Indicator Explorer di Gallery) dapat membangun antarmuka dari metadata tersebut.

#!csharp

Console.WriteLine($"{IndicatorCatalog.Count} catalogue entries");
foreach (var category in Enum.GetValues<IndicatorCategory>())
    Console.WriteLine($"  {category,-15} {IndicatorCatalog.ByCategory(category).Count(),3}   e.g. {string.Join(", ", IndicatorCatalog.ByCategory(category).Take(4).Select(d => d.Id))}");

var bb = IndicatorCatalog.Get("BBANDS");
var outputs = bb.Compute(bars, new Dictionary<string, double> { ["period"] = 20, ["k"] = 2 });
Console.WriteLine($"{bb.Name}: outputs {string.Join(", ", outputs.Select(o => o.Name))}");

#!markdown

## Trend, momentum, volatility / Tren, momentum, volatilitas

**EN.** RSI uses Wilder's smoothing; MACD is the 12/26 EMA difference with a 9-period signal line; Bollinger bands sit k standard deviations around a 20-day SMA.

**ID.** RSI memakai pemulusan Wilder; MACD adalah selisih EMA 12/26 dengan garis sinyal 9 periode; pita Bollinger berada k simpangan baku di sekitar SMA 20 hari.

#!csharp

var sma50 = Ta.Sma(close, 50);
var ema20 = Ta.Ema(close, 20);
var rsi = Ta.Rsi(close, 14);
var macd = Ta.Macd(close);
var bands = Ta.Bollinger(close, 20, 2);
var atr = Ta.Atr(high, low, close, 14);
var obv = Ta.Obv(close, volume);

Console.WriteLine($"Close {close[^1]:F2} | SMA50 {sma50[^1]:F2} | EMA20 {ema20[^1]:F2} | RSI {rsi[^1]:F1}");
Console.WriteLine($"MACD {macd.Macd[^1]:F3} signal {macd.Signal[^1]:F3} hist {macd.Histogram[^1]:F3}");
Console.WriteLine($"Bollinger [{bands.Lower[^1]:F2}, {bands.Upper[^1]:F2}] %B {bands.PercentB[^1]:F2} | ATR {atr[^1]:F2} | OBV {obv[^1]:N0}");

var overlays = new[]
{
    new LineSeries("Upper", bands.Upper) { Color = "#2DD4BF" },
    new LineSeries("SMA 20", bands.Middle) { Color = "#FBBF24" },
    new LineSeries("Lower", bands.Lower) { Color = "#F472B6" },
};
display(HTML(Charts.Candlestick(bars, new ChartOptions { Title = "Bollinger Bands (20, 2)", Height = 420 }, overlays)));
display(HTML(Charts.Line(new[] { new LineSeries("RSI 14", rsi) { Color = "#A78BFA" } },
    new ChartOptions { Title = "RSI (14)", Height = 220 }, bars.Select(b => b.Time).ToList())));

#!markdown

## Candlestick patterns / Pola candlestick

**EN.** Pattern detectors return +100 (bullish), −100 (bearish) or 0 for each bar, the same convention as TA-Lib.

**ID.** Detektor pola menghasilkan +100 (bullish), −100 (bearish) atau 0 untuk setiap bar, konvensi yang sama dengan TA-Lib.

#!csharp

var hits = Candlesticks.Scan(bars);
Console.WriteLine($"{hits.Count} pattern signals in {bars.Length} bars");
foreach (var g in hits.GroupBy(h => h.Pattern).OrderByDescending(g => g.Count()).Take(8))
    Console.WriteLine($"  {g.Key,-22} {g.Count(),3}  (last on {bars[g.Last().Index].Time:yyyy-MM-dd})");

#!markdown

## Streaming indicators / Indikator streaming

**EN.** Live systems update indicators one bar at a time. The streaming classes reproduce the batch results exactly, in O(1) per update.

**ID.** Sistem langsung memperbarui indikator satu bar demi satu bar. Kelas streaming menghasilkan nilai yang persis sama dengan versi batch, dengan biaya O(1) per pembaruan.

#!csharp

var liveRsi = new StreamingRsi(14);
var liveBands = new StreamingBollinger(20, 2);
foreach (var bar in bars) { liveRsi.Update(bar); liveBands.Update(bar); }
Console.WriteLine($"Streaming RSI {liveRsi.Value:F6} vs batch {rsi[^1]:F6}");
Console.WriteLine($"Streaming upper band {liveBands.Upper:F6} vs batch {bands.Upper[^1]:F6}");

#!markdown

## Rust acceleration / Akselerasi Rust

**EN.** `Finance.RustBridge` exposes the same kernels implemented in Rust and falls back to managed code when the native library is missing. Results agree to floating-point precision.

**ID.** `Finance.RustBridge` menyediakan kernel yang sama yang ditulis dalam Rust dan kembali ke kode managed bila pustaka native tidak tersedia. Hasilnya sama hingga presisi floating-point.

#!csharp

Console.WriteLine(RustAccelerator.Describe());
var fastSma = FastIndicators.Sma(close, 50);
var fastRsi = FastIndicators.Rsi(close, 14);
Console.WriteLine($"SMA50 rust/managed difference {Math.Abs(fastSma[^1] - sma50[^1]):E2}; RSI difference {Math.Abs(fastRsi[^1] - rsi[^1]):E2}");
